press, React, Node.js) and in AI/ML engineering. He builds scalable systems that bridge real-world usability with solid backend architecture — from OCR pipelines to AI coding assistants and agentic systems. His work spans web applications, AI/ML pipelines, and data-driven platforms. He believes in practical implementation over theory, and continuously integrates new technologies into meaningful software. ## Quick facts - Name: Kishore Selvaraj - Degree: Integrated M.Sc. in Information Technology - College: College of Engineering, Guindy (CEG), Anna University - Location: Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India - Primary focus: Full Stack Development (MERN) + AI/ML - Interests: Agentic AI systems, SaaS products, RAG pipelines, developer tooling - Availability: Open to new opportunities, collaborations, and interesting projects. ## Contact - Email: kishore.tech.codes@gmail.com - GitHub: https://github.com/kishorevijay07", "source": "profile", "vector": [-0.03369, 0.07113, -0.000777, -0.043599, 0.001127, -0.014971, 0.009782, 0.034494, -0.026285, 0.047991, 0.027959, -0.067916, -0.006595, 0.025094, 0.113015, 0.02417, -0.037761, -0.03835, 0.071987, 0.03527, 0.057847, -0.025964, -0.007646, -0.065399, 0.046251, -0.010933, -0.016028, -0.088002, -0.017233, -0.177289, 0.047081, 0.037306, 0.003415, 0.070434, -0.01242, 0.011556, 0.010384, 0.019188, -0.004616, -0.034574, 0.011884, 0.005898, 0.02275, 0.031253, 0.09068, -0.063524, -0.00784, 0.00022, -0.065881, -0.075361, 0.003408, -0.033637, 0.008503, 0.012687, -0.018238, 0.010485, 0.044965, 0.088538, 0.021693, 0.062239, -0.005185, 0.013859, -0.129512, 0.049304, 0.022965, 0.026888, -0.003425, -0.077236, -0.01165, 0.0767, -0.000829, -0.020594, 0.00851, -0.012708, 0.029379, -0.005577, 0.037734, 0.063738, 0.070916, -0.018037, -0.03286, -0.058329, -0.027932, 0.022201, -0.032699, 0.036931, -0.014328, -0.020943, 0.029191, 0.004332, 0.079004, 0.059561, -0.002871, -0.016443, -0.000143, 0.00171, -0.001948, 0.002678, -0.005955, 0.400856, 0.005858, -0.052